The evidence points to a single fault. I'll write up the answer from the queries already run.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_response_body_corrupted",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT a.span_name, a.attr_http_response_status_code, b.service_name callee, b.span_name callee_span, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces a LEFT JOIN abnormal_traces b ON b.parent_span_id = a.span_id AND b.trace_id=a.trace_id WHERE a.service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND a.span_name='POST' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 20",
          "claim": "Preserve's outbound POST to seat-service returns 405 on 806 calls; the callee receives GET /error instead of POST /seats."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-preserve-service','ts-seat-service') AND (attr_status_code='Error' OR attr_http_response_status_code >= 400) GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC",
          "claim": "Preserve's POST /api/v1/preserveservice/preserve returns status 500 with Error on 806 spans; seat-service's GET /error returns 405."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, left(message,250) m, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name IN ('ts-preserve-service','ts-seat-service') AND (level='SEVERE' OR level='WARN') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 10",
          "claim": "Seat-service logs 'Request method GET not supported' and preserve logs SEVERE HttpClientErrorException 405 Method Not Allowed, 806 times each."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%preserve%' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC",
          "claim": "Dashboard's POST /api/v1/preserveservice/preserve calls error out (Error status, about 7.4 s average) in the abnormal window."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

